{"id":"2051713916867187560","kind":"answer","title":"怎样学日语最快，多邻国好用吗？","author":"Jarrett Ye","original_authors":["Jarrett Ye"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"外语习得","date":"2026-06-20","updated":"2026-06-20","votes":257,"comment_count":34,"minutes":1,"chars":696,"keywords":["Refold","二语习得","沉浸式学习","词句挖掘","口语练习"],"summary":"我用多邻国用了三天就受不了了，三天才学十几个词，这要学到猴年马月才能达到母语者水平（词汇量两万六以上 [1] ）。 建议多看点日本动画和轻小说，我从去年八月底开始学日语，平均每天看两集生肉，目前已经看了三十几部番，从今年二月份开始读日语轻小说，日均阅读一小时，目前已经读了七本，查了一万六千多个词，每天背二三十个新词，目前已经背…","question_detail_html":"","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/1997992954565002373/answer/2051713916867187560","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"相关回答"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"1W9gBngf\">我用多邻国用了三天就受不了了，三天才学十几个词，这要学到猴年马月才能达到母语者水平（词汇量两万六以上<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>）。</p><p data-pid=\"X99C9Fke\">建议多看点日本动画和轻小说，我从去年八月底开始学日语，平均每天看两集生肉，目前已经看了三十几部番，从今年二月份开始读日语轻小说，日均阅读一小时，目前已经读了七本，查了一万六千多个词，每天背二三十个新词，目前已经背了七千多个。</p><p data-pid=\"TwNVNu7a\">目前看平均水平的番，已经可以听懂 85% 以上了，简单的番可以听懂 95% 以上，简单的轻小说目前阅读速度也从一开始的五六千字每小时提升到了一万四左右。</p><p data-pid=\"scR_e3Kp\">下面是我让 codex 根据我平时学习的记录生成的统计报告：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-05b683a145dc8e18a66b589e7e8b42ed\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-05b683a145dc8e18a66b589e7e8b42ed_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2396\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-05b683a145dc8e18a66b589e7e8b42ed\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-05b683a145dc8e18a66b589e7e8b42ed_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2396\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"WpXBpgAo\">不定期更新：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://l-m-sherlock.github.io/japanese-mining-report/lapis_mining_timeline_report.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">日语挖词时间线</a></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-f3d7a5bed7f2d7ebeac55f586c67855b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-f3d7a5bed7f2d7ebeac55f586c67855b_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2406\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-f3d7a5bed7f2d7ebeac55f586c67855b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-f3d7a5bed7f2d7ebeac55f586c67855b_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2406\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"WQuce02s\">不定期更新：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://l-m-sherlock.github.io/japanese-mining-report/lapis_source_report.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">日语挖卡报告</a></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-a5b520cbfb518ffa6ca8cd81885e1fe1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-a5b520cbfb518ffa6ca8cd81885e1fe1_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2424\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-a5b520cbfb518ffa6ca8cd81885e1fe1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-a5b520cbfb518ffa6ca8cd81885e1fe1_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2424\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-2fd9bcf55489a64dff2606cb34dda835\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-2fd9bcf55489a64dff2606cb34dda835_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2420\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-2fd9bcf55489a64dff2606cb34dda835\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-2fd9bcf55489a64dff2606cb34dda835_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"2420\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"f31vZoAc\">不定期更新：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://l-m-sherlock.github.io/japanese-reading-stats/books_reading_report.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Books Reading Report</a></p><hr/><p data-pid=\"Nrbqa1Cj\">我平时学日语的录播发在 B 站了，目前已经发了 40 期：</p><a class=\"wrap external\" data-draft-cover=\"\" data-draft-title=\"[学日语] 边看高木同学边学日语 (2025-11-11)\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1WEkyBTEP2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">[学日语] 边看高木同学边学日语 (2025-11-11)</a><p data-pid=\"YcbD9dDv\">想要快速学日语，我推荐阅读以下内容：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ad9fd00d617ba3c3b92524e9c77ef66b.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"从 0 开始学外语：Refold 路线图（详细版）\" data-tm-id=\"671671625\" href=\"#/post/671671625\">从 0 开始学外语：Refold 路线图（详细版）</a><a class=\"internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-62ee5a7955e0500d683f8200ad3f3364.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"日语学习：萌萌二次元之路\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2005777505055967011\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">日语学习：萌萌二次元之路</a><a class=\"wrap external\" data-draft-cover=\"\" data-draft-title=\"‍⁠﻿​​​​﻿​​﻿‬‌‬​⁠​​​‬​​‍‌⁠​​​​‍﻿​​​​​‌⁠​⁠‍​‬​⁠‌​‌​﻿基于二语习得理论的日语学习指南 - 飞书云文档\" href=\"https://my.feishu.cn/wiki/YeOSwsG7giLuQxkcDFscUXVZn2f\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">‍⁠﻿​​​​﻿​​﻿‬‌‬​⁠​​​‬​​‍‌⁠​​​​‍﻿​​​​​‌⁠​⁠‍​‬​⁠‌​‌​﻿基于二语习得理论的日语学习指南 - 飞书云文档</a><h2 id=\"sec-1\">相关回答</h2><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-4727c4b1388501647bf49340c78e2762.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"谁能告知一下日语怎么入门？\" data-tm-id=\"2050279744311146150\" href=\"#/post/2050279744311146150\">谁能告知一下日语怎么入门？</a><a class=\"internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-cbd397721914f2d7866215b936db6ff1.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackg